    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-5a4a77a71f1c81a525d73595",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统型别对于单位反馈结构中的参数变化具有鲁棒性。例如，如果过程参数发生变化而未消除 I 型系统位于原点的极点，则速度误差系数会发生改变，但系统对常值输入的稳态误差仍为零，且系统仍然为 I 型系统。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "System type is a robust property with respect to parameter changes in the unity feedback structure. For example, if the process parameters change without removing the pole at the origin in a Type 1 system, the velocity constant will change but the system will still have zero steady-state error in response to a constant input and will still be Type 1.",
